Recommends: pipewire
Description: desktop widgets that live under your Wayland shell
 Audio visualizers, clocks and a now-playing card for Wayland compositors
 that support the layer-shell protocol. They sit above the wallpaper and
 below the windows; with Noctalia they take its palette and, through its
 depth plugin, pass behind the subject of the wallpaper.
